        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>腊八粥阅读批注</title>\n  <script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n  <script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #ddd8cb;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n      color: #292521;\n    }\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 4px 14px 12px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(circle at 8% 12%, rgba(80,65,45,.12) 0 1px, transparent 1.5px),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 35%, rgba(80,65,45,.08) 0 1px, transparent 1.5px),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 35% 78%, rgba(80,65,45,.09) 0 1px, transparent 1.5px),\n        #f8f7f1;\n      background-size: 73px 61px, 109px 95px, 91px 77px;\n    }\n    .top-note {\n      font-size: 17px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      line-height: 1.25;\n      letter-spacing: .2px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .top-note .indent { padding-left: 245px; }\n    .red-circle {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: center;\n      width: 22px;\n      height: 22px;\n      margin: 0 4px;\n      border: 2px solid #c72d2d;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      color: #bd2727;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n    .divider {\n      height: 24px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(80,75,65,.18);\n      margin: 0 -14px 8px;\n    }\n    .intro {\n      position: relative;\n      margin-left: 66px;\n      width: 438px;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      line-height: 1.24;\n      text-indent: 2em;\n    }\n    .brace {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 28px;\n      top: 124px;\n      width: 27px;\n      height: 54px;\n      border-left: 1.5px solid #3c3028;\n      border-radius: 55% 0 0 55%;\n      transform: rotate(-22deg);\n    }\n    .text {\n      position: relative;\n      margin-top: 3px;\n      padding-left: 28px;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: 1.42;\n    }\n    .para {\n      margin: 3px 0;\n      text-indent: 0;\n    }\n    .line1 {\n      text-indent: 0;\n      margin-left: 0;\n    }\n    .quote { letter-spacing: .1px; }\n    .hand {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 2;\n      color: #413a35;\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", cursive;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1;\n      transform: rotate(-5deg);\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .red {\n      color: #bc2526;\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n    .under {\n      text-decoration: underline;\n      text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n      text-underline-offset: 2px;\n    }\n    .mark1 { left: 85px; top: 105px; }\n    .mark2 { left: 120px; top: 155px; }\n    .mark3 { left: 335px; top: 171px; }\n    .mark4 { left: 346px; top: 232px; }\n    .mark5 { left: 226px; top: 267px; }\n    .mark6 { left: 298px; top: 304px; }\n    .mark7 { left: 130px; top: 361px; }\n    .mark8 { left: 263px; top: 394px; }\n    .mark9 { left: 247px; top: 447px; }\n    .mark10 { left: 242px; top: 499px; }\n    .mark11 { left: 78px; top: 654px; font-size: 17px; }\n    .circle-note {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 1;\n      border: 1.5px solid #51413b;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      opacity: .85;\n    }\n    .c1 { width: 80px; height: 33px; left: 227px; top: 261px; transform: rotate(-9deg); }\n    .c2 { width: 108px; height: 31px; left: 188px; top: 403px; transform: rotate(-10deg); }\n    .bottom {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 49px;\n      bottom: 4px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      color: #47423c;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"top-note\">第二部分:(2～17)写粥，写八儿盼吃粥时的情态。可分为(2～8)盼粥，</div>\n    <div class=\"top-note indent\">(9～11)想粥，(12～13)猜粥，(14～17)看粥。</div>\n    <div class=\"top-note\">第三部分:(18～19)喝粥。写<span class=\"red-circle\">2</span> 腊八粥 家乡人儿吃腊八粥的情景。</div>\n    <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"intro\">\n      首句使用了排比的修辞手法，写出了无论什么年龄段的人在腊八粥面前都难以抵挡的诱惑，可见腊八粥受欢迎的程度。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"brace\"></div>\n\n    <section class=\"text\">\n      <p class=\"para line1\">1. 初学喊爸爸的小孩子，会出门叫洋车了的大孩子，嘴巴上长了许多白胡子的老孩子，提到腊八粥，谁不是嘴里就立时生出一种甜甜的腻腻的感觉呢。把小米、饭豆、枣、栗、白糖、花生仁合拢来，糊糊涂涂煮成一锅，让它在锅中叹气似的沸腾着，单看它那叹气样儿，闻闻那种香味，就够咽三口以上的唾沫了，何况是，大碗大碗地装着，大匙大匙朝嘴里塞灌呢！</p>\n\n      <p class=\"para\">2. 住方家大院的八儿，今天喜得快要发疯了。他一个人进进出出灶房，看到一大锅粥正在叹气，锅盖都已预备整齐，摆到灶边好久了，但妈妈总是说时候还早。</p>\n\n      <p class=\"para\">3. 他妈妈正拿起一把锅铲在粥里搅和。锅里的粥也像是益发浓稠了。</p>\n\n      <p class=\"para\">4. <span class=\"quote\">“妈，妈，要到什么时候才……”</span></p>\n\n      <p class=\"para\">5. <span class=\"quote\">“要到夜里！”</span>其实他妈妈所说的夜里，并不是上灯以后。但八儿听了这种松劲的话，眼睛可急红了。锅中的粥，有声无力的叹气还在继续。</p>\n\n      <p class=\"para\">6. <span class=\"quote\">“那我饿了！”</span>八儿要哭的样子。</p>\n\n      <p class=\"para\">7. <span class=\"quote\">“饿了，也得到太阳落下时才准吃。”</span>八儿怎么就饿了呢！</p>\n\n      <p class=\"para\">8. 饿了，也得到太阳落下时才准吃。并且八儿所说的还不够够饿的八儿，难道还能设什么法来反抗吗？</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <span class=\"hand mark1\">粥面前都难以抵挡的诱惑</span>\n    <span class=\"hand mark2\">内容交代：八儿想喝粥，难以抵挡</span>\n    <span class=\"hand mark3\">运用拟人的修辞手法，生动的</span>\n    <span class=\"hand mark4\">夸张的修辞手法，渲染了把粥的程</span>\n    <span class=\"hand mark5\">喜得快要发疯了</span>\n    <span class=\"hand mark6\">此处表现了急切心情</span>\n    <span class=\"hand mark7 red\">用？两声连叫写出八儿急切的心情。</span>\n    <span class=\"hand mark8 red\">“要到夜里”表现妈妈的无奈</span>\n    <span class=\"hand mark9 red\">急红了，锅中的粥</span>\n    <span class=\"hand mark10 red\">“那我饿了！”八儿要哭的样子</span>\n    <span class=\"hand mark11\">文句：八儿连着<span class=\"under\">急</span>着没精力设想将来的命令。</span>\n\n    <span class=\"circle-note c1\"></span>\n    <span class=\"circle-note c2\"></span>\n\n    <div class=\"bottom\">本文作者沈从文，选作课文时有改动。原名：《沈石溪·代表作：小说〈边城〉》</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
